verdict:
The strategy starts right. It treats the question as something to test, not something to argue about, it fixes the verdict before the test starts, and it keeps every audience string free of invented facts. The revision improves attribution a lot: inquiries count by any route, reps ask «Откуда узнали?», and the verdict divides by total hours across all staff.

What would actually reach people is broken, though, and nothing could ever be published.
- **The staff card is stale.** The code-written week-1 card still has staff film content the revision retired or banned: water poured «на глаз» (ID13), «пальцем проводите по инею на плёнке» (against the new FROST RULE), the late-truck POV (ID10, held) and the truck tally (ID17, dropped).
- **The owner card is stale too.** It carries the pre-revision asks. Eight of its 12 items reach the owner as English labels, and one repeats the privacy promise the boss reviewer called false: «наружу ничего не попадает».
- **The blocking ask is deferred.** The blocking "fact pack" (what the business can truthfully say) gates every post, yet it sits in questions_deferred. This still happens with the current owner_card code.

The ideas are weak for this audience. Reviewers held, dropped or rewrote 6 of the 8 slate ideas. Of the two that survive as written, ID14 is an advert ("how to message us") and ID02 is generic stretch-film ASMR. ID10, ID19 and ID07 put on our own premises the very failures (a late truck, frost on our stock) customers could blame us for. ID13 lectures professionals on their own trade.

The test design leans toward NO:
- a brand-new, one-city account with 0 ₸;
- forwarding by reps defaulted to "no", even though the intake itself calls reps the stronger lever;
- 2GIS treated as a mere "control";
- a threshold of "3 inquiries + 1 invoice" that is noise;
- no step that fetched outside data, so the seasonal premise ("first frost" in late October in Karaganda) is likely stale.

After revision the creator reviewer still rejects (5/10). The boss reviewer "approves" at 6/10, which F13 forbids. Nobody should run this as is. The strategic core can be saved once the code issues below are fixed.

